Package: binmetrics
Type: Package
Title: Binary Classification Evaluation Metrics with Threshold Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Julen", "Perales", email = "julen.perales@unavarra.es",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))
Description: Tools for computing, comparing, and visualising binary classification
    evaluation metrics across the full range of decision thresholds. Implements
    agreement metrics (OA, BA, MCC, Kappa, F1) and skill metrics (FOM/CSI, GSS,
    PSS, ETS, HSS) together with their theoretical upper and lower bounds.
    Provides integrated metrics (AFOM, AUFOM, DFOM, DAUC) based on area ratios
    over the Threshold Operating Characteristic (TOC) space. Includes a
    publication-quality ggplot2 visualisation layer and interactive Shiny
    applications for pedagogical exploration of threshold effects.
